    "title": "Bible Audio - KJV Daily Verse",
    "description": "THE GREAT FREE BIBLE STUDY TOOL that allows you to <b>read, learn and share</b> the King James Version Bible anytime anywhere. Uniting millions of devoted souls, this fast and lightweight Bible app is your best companion for <b>daily Bible reading and prayers</b>.\r\n\r\nThis pocket Holy Bible app inspires you with <b>daily Bible verse</b>. With a <b>personalized experience</b>, you can quickly locate verses with a simple click, and create highlights, bookmarks and notes. Share your discoveries with friends and grow with God's word together.\r\n\r\n<b>Daily King James Bible Reading</b>\r\n- Learn God's Word at fingertips\r\n- Get closer to God for spiritual growth\r\n- Build strong connection to your faith\r\n\r\n<b>All-in-one Bible Study Tool</b>\r\n- Read KJV Bible offline anytime, anywhere without internet\r\n- No heavy paper book, easily access on your device\r\n- Daily verse selection\r\n- Timely prayer reminders\r\n- Quickly locate verse \r\n- Easily search Bible book, scriptures with keywords\r\n- Share custom verses with friends via social media\r\n- Keep a record of your prayer journal\r\n- Copy and paste verses with one tap\r\n- Sync your highlights, bookmarks, notes to your account\r\n\r\n<b>Create Your Bible Verse Collection</b>\r\n- Highlight Bible verses with different color\r\n- Add bookmark to verses you wish to revisit\r\n- Take notes to capture your profound insights\r\n\r\n<b>Custom Your Bible Experience</b>\r\n- Create your verses card with custom photo, font, and arrangement\r\n- Adjust font size for a comfortable Holy Bible reading experience\r\n\r\nDownload this KJV Bible verses study tool to unlock a world of divine wisdom and inner peace. Let the King James Version Bible app illuminate your path towards spiritual fulfillment.",
    "descriptionHTML": "THE GREAT FREE BIBLE STUDY TOOL that allows you to <b>read, learn and share</b> the King James Version Bible anytime anywhere. Uniting millions of devoted souls, this fast and lightweight Bible app is your best companion for <b>daily Bible reading and prayers</b>.<br><br>This pocket Holy Bible app inspires you with <b>daily Bible verse</b>. With a <b>personalized experience</b>, you can quickly locate verses with a simple click, and create highlights, bookmarks and notes. Share your discoveries with friends and grow with God&#39;s word together.<br><br><b>Daily King James Bible Reading</b><br>- Learn God&#39;s Word at fingertips<br>- Get closer to God for spiritual growth<br>- Build strong connection to your faith<br><br><b>All-in-one Bible Study Tool</b><br>- Read KJV Bible offline anytime, anywhere without internet<br>- No heavy paper book, easily access on your device<br>- Daily verse selection<br>- Timely prayer reminders<br>- Quickly locate verse <br>- Easily search Bible book, scriptures with keywords<br>- Share custom verses with friends via social media<br>- Keep a record of your prayer journal<br>- Copy and paste verses with one tap<br>- Sync your highlights, bookmarks, notes to your account<br><br><b>Create Your Bible Verse Collection</b><br>- Highlight Bible verses with different color<br>- Add bookmark to verses you wish to revisit<br>- Take notes to capture your profound insights<br><br><b>Custom Your Bible Experience</b><br>- Create your verses card with custom photo, font, and arrangement<br>- Adjust font size for a comfortable Holy Bible reading experience<br><br>Download this KJV Bible verses study tool to unlock a world of divine wisdom and inner peace. Let the King James Version Bible app illuminate your path towards spiritual fulfillment.",
